 ("What is the cheapest cargo from China to Pakistan?", "Per kilo, sea cargo is cheapest for large volumes, but it has fixed port charges and a minimum, so for small shipments air cargo or courier can work out cheaper overall."),
 ("Is cargo the same as courier?", "No. Courier is one type of cargo service where one company carries and clears a parcel end to end. Air cargo and sea cargo use forwarders, airlines or shipping lines and a separate clearing agent."),
 ("Do cargo companies include customs duty?", "Some do and some do not, and some include it only for certain goods. Ask in writing whether duty is included for your exact product."),
